  "improvements": [
    "The canonical source-based Space Needle model and exact source footprint are integrated into Seattle Center.",
    "Source parts, courtyards and valid roof surfaces remain represented; single-pass thin glass reduces work without removing geometry."
  ],
  "remainingGaps": [
    "Arrival and entrance queues put visitors very close to the camera; one pedestrian/collider finding remains and needs physical correction without dropping visitors.",
    "The nearby tree canopy partly obscures the upward postcard. Access, sight lines and public plaza boundaries need matched independent scene comparisons.",
    "The earlier lift work is retained, but this 24-destination context pass does not by itself prove the complete lift/pause/drone/touch sequence.",
    "Raw audit findings remain for physical review: zfight 53, phantom 1, pedBelow 3, pedCollider 1."
  ],
